three-coordinate decomposition into common-scale density `kappa`, reciprocal depth `phi`, and
shift `beta`. Matched endpoint differences of `kappa` and `phi` are exact additive characters.
The path-labelled normal transport `U_gamma` is an independent angular groupoid arrow.

The smallest assembly reproducing the already-banked pair-metric and normal-transport layers is
therefore a state-decorated path groupoid: objects carry `(h equivalently kappa,phi,beta)`, the
